namespace AxisRemapMigration
/- These are transparent old-caller specializations, not new runtime bindings.
The old Axis record has only values/first. Its stored first observation is kept
with an opaque Unit first-index witness, then a separate pure getindex operation.
This retains the entire former arbitrary Axis domain, including empty values;
it does not assert that those records implement a concrete Julia range. -/
/--
Pure specialization of the canonical tuple remapping family, using the existing ifelse leaf.
Julia source: base/broadcast.jl:587-590 @ f755f49a9e41380d7da126b3c1db9fe7f83dd027
```julia
