    thm := none,
    notes := "Complete Value/CoreM partial_fixpoint model, with no List restriction, structural-decrease hypothesis or caller fuel. Reuses NewIndex.callIfElse and installed Index.m600/m601/m602. Registered property covers actual generic/empty/custom recursive helper branches, eager failures over all callees, all custom ifelse/suffix outcomes, and closed-form traces for arbitrary positive finite recursion depths. Lists/cursors in properties are observation data only. No proofs or compilation claims." }
